---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const meta = {
  "title": "Privacy - Marathon & More Calculator",
  "description": "Exactly what MarathonCalculator.com measures and what it never collects. Plain English, no legal fog.",
  "ogType": "website",
  "ogDescription": "Exactly what we measure and what we never collect. Plain English, no legal fog.",
  "path": "/privacy"
};
---
<Base {...meta}>
  <style slot="head" is:global>
  :root{
    --paper:#F4F5F1; --ink:#121A22; --muted:#5C6672; --line:#E2E5DD;
    --blue:#2447C7; --tape:#FFD23F;
    --disp:"Barlow Semi Condensed","Arial Narrow",sans-serif;
    --body:"Barlow",-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--body); font-size:16.5px; line-height:1.65}
  .wrap{max-width:680px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 16px 72px}
  header{padding:28px 0 20px; border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px; position:relative}
  header::after{content:""; position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:-8px; height:3px; background:var(--blue)}
  .brand{font-family:var(--disp); font-weight:800; font-size:clamp(22px,5vw,30px); letter-spacing:.5px; text-transform:uppercase; line-height:1}
  .brand a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none}
  .brand em{font-style:normal; color:var(--blue)}
  nav{margin-top:8px; font-size:15px}
  nav a{color:var(--blue); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; margin-right:14px; position:relative}
  nav a::after{content:""; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:-2px; height:2px; width:100%;
    background:var(--blue); transform:scaleX(0); transform-origin:left; transition:transform .2s ease-out}
  nav a:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
  h1{font-family:var(--disp); font-weight:800; font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,36px); margin:32px 0 6px}
  h2{font-family:var(--disp); font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.7px; font-size:16px; margin:28px 0 8px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom:6px}
  p, li{margin:0 0 12px}
  ul{padding-left:22px; margin:0 0 14px}
  a{color:var(--blue)}
  .yes{border-left:4px solid #1D7A46; background:#F0F7F2; border-radius:0 10px 10px 0; padding:12px 16px; margin-bottom:14px}
  .no{border-left:4px solid var(--blue); background:#E9EDFB; border-radius:0 10px 10px 0; padding:12px 16px; margin-bottom:14px}
  footer{margin-top:44px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--muted); text-align:center; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:16px}
  footer a{color:var(--blue)}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ *,*::before,*::after{transition:none !important} }
  </style>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="brand"><a href="/">Marathon <em>&amp; More</em> Calculator</a></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Calculator</a>
      <a href="/about">How we built it</a>
      <a href="/marathoncalculator/">About us</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/7pdaddy/marathoncalculator">GitHub</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <h1>Privacy, in Plain English</h1>
  <p>This is a free hobby site run by one runner. There is nothing to sell you
  and nothing to sell about you. Here is the complete picture, no legal fog.</p>

  <h2>What we measure</h2>
  <div class="yes">
    <p><b>Anonymous visit counts.</b> We use GoatCounter, a cookieless,
    privacy-focused counter. It tells us things like which pages get visited,
    where visitors came from, roughly what country visits come from, and what
    kind of device was used (phone or desktop). That is how we know whether anyone finds the site useful.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What we never collect</h2>
  <div class="no">
    <p>No cookies. No accounts. No email capture. No advertising or ad
    networks. No fingerprinting profiles. No selling or sharing of data,
    because there is no personal data to sell. We cannot identify you and do
    not want to.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Your race plans stay with you</h2>
  <p>Plans you build in the calculator are saved in your own browser's local
  storage so they are still there when you come back. They are never sent to a
  server. Clearing your browser data erases them. Shared plan links contain
  only the numbers you can see in the link itself.</p>

  <h2>Third parties, fully listed</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Cloudflare</b> hosts the site, so like any host it processes requests
    (including IP addresses) to deliver pages.</li>
    <li><b>Google Fonts</b> serves the site's typefaces from Google's servers,
    which sees standard font requests, as on most of the web.</li>
    <li><b>GoatCounter</b> provides the anonymous, cookieless visit counting
    described above. It runs only on the site pages and the full-page
    calculator, never inside embeds on other sites.</li>
    <li><b>YouTube</b> appears only on one blog post that embeds a video, and
    only loads if you visit that post.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>That is the entire list. The site's code is
  <a href="https://github.com/7pdaddy/marathoncalculator">open source</a>, so
  you can verify every word of this page yourself.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Open an issue on
  <a href="https://github.com/7pdaddy/marathoncalculator/issues">GitHub</a> and
  ask. Being able to answer this page honestly matters more to us than any
  statistic we could collect.</p>

  <footer>
    <a href="https://marathoncalculator.com">MarathonCalculator.com</a> ·
    free &amp; open source · built by a runner, for runners
  </footer>
</div>
</Base>
